! Proposed Definitions And Examples

!! Template

;__WORD__ (SELMAHO):  KEY Tags a sumti as fitting the NTH place of BRIVLA.  Augments the bridi in which it occurs, adding an extra, un-numbered place with the meaning of the BRIVLA place of NTH and then fills it with the tagged sumti.  In other words, the tagged sumti indicates that the event described by the bridi is LONGDESC the referent of the tagged sumti.  See also:


!! Proposed Definition of ''si'u''

;__si'u__ (BAI):  Aided by.  Tags a sumti as fitting the 1st place of sidju.  Augments the bridi in which it occurs, adding an extra, un-numbered place with the meaning of the 1st place of sidju and then fills it with the tagged sumti.  In other words, the tagged sumti indicates that the event described by the bridi is aided or assisted in some way by the referent of the tagged sumti.  See also: se si'u, te si'u, sidju
** Keywords: aided by, assisted by.

!! Examples of ''si'u'' Usage

''mi bevri lo pipno si'u la djan .e la frank''
I carry the piano, helped by John and Frank.

!! Proposed Definition of ''se si'u''

;__se si'u__ (BAI*):  Assisting.  Tags a sumti as fitting the 2nd place of sidju.  Augments the bridi in which it occurs, adding an extra, un-numbered place with the meaning of the 2nd place of sidju and then fills it with the tagged sumti.  In other words, the tagged sumti indicates that the event described by the bridi is involved in assisting or aiding (in doing or acheiving something) the referent of the tagged sumti.  See also: si'u, te si'u, sidju
** Keywords: Assisting.

!! Examples of ''se si'u'' Usage

''mi bevri lo pipno se si'u la djan''
I carry the piano to help John.

!! Proposed Definition of ''te si'u''

;__te si'u__ (BAI*):  Assisting in.  Tags a sumti as fitting the 3rd place of sidju.  Augments the bridi in which it occurs, adding an extra, un-numbered place with the meaning of the 3rd place of sidju and then fills it with the tagged sumti.  In other words, the tagged sumti indicates that the event described by the bridi is associated with assisting in or with doing or achieving the referent of the tagged sumti.  See also: si'u, se si'u, sidju
** Keywords: Assisting in, assisting with.

!! Examples of ''te si'u'' Usage

''mi bevri lo pipno te si'u lo nu la djan kakne lo nu rapyze'u''
I carry the piano so John can practice.

!! Proposed Definition of ''va'u''

;__va'u__ (BAI):  Benefiting from.  Tags a sumti as fitting the 1st place of xamgu.  Augments the bridi in which it occurs, adding an extra, un-numbered place with the meaning of the 1st place of xamgu and then fills it with the tagged sumti.  In other words, the tagged sumti indicates that the event described by the bridi is associated with an object or event which is good and is the referent of the tagged sumti.  See also: xamgu, se va'u, te va'u.
** Keywords: Benefiting from.

!! Examples of ''va'u'' Usage

''mi jerna lo jdini va'u lo nu lo kagni pikta be mi cu zenba lo vamji''
I earn money with the beneficial event of my stocks going up.

* I think "lo vamji" is sufficient (rather than lo ni vamji) because the x1 of vamji is already a ni.  Comments?

!! Proposed Definition of ''se va'u''

;__se va'u__ (BAI*):  With beneficiary.  Tags a sumti as fitting the 2nd place of xamgu.  Augments the bridi in which it occurs, adding an extra, un-numbered place with the meaning of the 2nd place of xamgu and then fills it with the tagged sumti.  In other words, the tagged sumti indicates that the event described by the bridi is a beneficiary, someone or something that benefits from it, and that beneficiary is the referent of the tagged sumti.  See also: xamgu, va'u, te va'u.
** Keywords: With beneficiary.

!! Examples of ''se va'u'' Usage

''mi pu terve'u lo nanba se va'u do''
I bought the bread for your benefit.

!! Proposed Definition of ''te va'u''

;__te va'u__ (BAI*):  Goodness standard.  Tags a sumti as fitting the 3rd place of xamgu.  Augments the bridi in which it occurs, adding an extra, un-numbered place with the meaning of the 3rd place of xamgu and then fills it with the tagged sumti.  In other words, the tagged sumti indicates that the event described by the bridi is good or beneficial in some way according to a standard indicated by the referent of the tagged sumti.  See also: xamgu, va'u, se va'u.
** Keywords:  Goodness standard.

!! Examples of ''te va'u'' Usage

''mi dunda lo nanba do te va'u lo si'o lo nu sidju cu vrude''
I gave you bread, which is a good thing because helping is virtuous.

!! Proposed Definition of ''fi'e''

;__fi'e__ (BAI):  Created by.  Tags a sumti as fitting the 1st place of finti.  Augments the bridi in which it occurs, adding an extra, un-numbered place with the meaning of the 1st place of finti and then fills it with the tagged sumti.  In other words, the tagged sumti indicates that the event described by the bridi is associated with the creation of something, and that the creator is the referent of the tagged sumti.  See also: finti, se fi'e, te fi'e, ve fi'e.
** Keywords: Created by.

!! Examples of ''fi'e'' Usage

''mi pilno lo karce fi'e la ford''
I use a car invented by Ford.

!! Proposed Definition of ''se fi'e''

;__se fi'e__ (BAI*):  Creating work.  Tags a sumti as fitting the 2nd place of finti.  Augments the bridi in which it occurs, adding an extra, un-numbered place with the meaning of the 2nd place of finti and then fills it with the tagged sumti.  In other words, the tagged sumti indicates that the event described by the bridi is associated with the creation of the referent of the tagged sumti.  See also: finti, fi'e, te fi'e, ve fi'e.
** Keywords: Creating work.

!! Examples of ''se fi'e'' Usage

''mi pilno le tadji se fi'e lo nanba''
I followed the instructions to make bread.

!! Proposed Definition of ''te fi'e''

;__te fi'e__ (BAI*):  Created for purpose.  Tags a sumti as fitting the 3rd place of finti.  Augments the bridi in which it occurs, adding an extra, un-numbered place with the meaning of the 3rd place of finti and then fills it with the tagged sumti.  In other words, the tagged sumti indicates that the event described by the bridi is associated with some event of creation, for a purpose indicated by the referent of the tagged sumti.  See also: finti, fi'e, se fi'e, ve fi'e.
** Keywords: Creation for purpose.

!! Examples of ''te fi'e'' Usage

__sigh__

''mi jmina lo ladru lo maxri lo pesxu te fi'o lo nanba''
I add milk to wheat to make a paste, with the goal of bread.

!! Proposed Definition of ''ve fi'e''

;__ve fi'e__ (BAI*):  Created from.  Tags a sumti as fitting the 4th place of finti.  Augments the bridi in which it occurs, adding an extra, un-numbered place with the meaning of the 4th place of finti and then fills it with the tagged sumti.  In other words, the tagged sumti indicates that the event described by the bridi is associated with an act of creation using pre-existing ideas or elements indicated by the referent of the tagged sumti.  See also: finti, fi'e, se fi'e, te fi'e.
** Keywords: Created from.

!! Examples of ''ve fi'e'' Usage

''mi tcidu lo lisri ve fi'e lo ranmi''
I write a story using mythological elements.

!! Proposed Definition of ''ci'o''

;__ci'o__ (BAI):  Emotionally felt by.  Tags a sumti as fitting the 1st place of cinmo.  Augments the bridi in which it occurs, adding an extra, un-numbered place with the meaning of the 1st place of cinmo and then fills it with the tagged sumti.  In other words, the tagged sumti indicates that the event described by the bridi is associated with the emotions of the referent of the tagged sumti.  See also: cinmo, se ci'o, te ci'o.
** Keywords:

!! Examples of ''ci'o'' Usage

''ci'o ko'a mi pu tavla do''
He/She/It got emotional about my talking to you.

!! Proposed Definition of ''se ci'o''

;__se ci'o__ (BAI*):  Emoting.  Tags a sumti as fitting the 2nd place of cinmo.  Augments the bridi in which it occurs, adding an extra, un-numbered place with the meaning of the 2nd place of cinmo and then fills it with the tagged sumti.  In other words, the tagged sumti indicates that the event described by the bridi is associated with the emotion indicated by the referent of the tagged sumti.  See also: cinmo, ci'o, te ci'o.
** Keywords: Emoting, Feeling.

!! Examples of ''se ci'o'' Usage

''la .alis. cadzu se ci'o lo ka gleki''
Alice is walking and there is a happy feeling.

!! Proposed Definition of ''te ci'o''

;__te ci'o__ (BAI*):  Emoting about.  Tags a sumti as fitting the 3rd place of cinmo.  Augments the bridi in which it occurs, adding an extra, un-numbered place with the meaning of the 3rd place of cinmo and then fills it with the tagged sumti.  In other words, the tagged sumti indicates that the event described by the bridi is associated with some feelings or emotions about the referent of the tagged sumti.  See also: cinmo, ci'o, se ci'o.
** Keywords: Emoting about.

!! Examples of ''te ci'o'' Usage

''la .bab. cusku te ci'o la .alis.''
Bob spoke, with feelings for Alice.

!! Proposed Definition of ''ri'i''

;__ri'i__ (BAI):  Experienced by.  Tags a sumti as fitting the 1st place of lifri.  Augments the bridi in which it occurs, adding an extra, un-numbered place with the meaning of the 1st place of lifri and then fills it with the tagged sumti.  In other words, the tagged sumti indicates that the event described by the bridi is experienced by the referent of the tagged sumti.  See also: lifri, se ri'i
** Keywords: Experienced by.

!! Examples of ''ri'i'' Usage

''le trene cu mutce sutra ri'i do''
The train is very fast, as you experienced.

!! Proposed Definition of ''se ri'i''

;__se ri'i__ (BAI*):  Experiencing.  Tags a sumti as fitting the 2nd place of lifri.  Augments the bridi in which it occurs, adding an extra, un-numbered place with the meaning of the 2nd place of lifri and then fills it with the tagged sumti.  In other words, the tagged sumti indicates that the event described by the bridi is associated with an experience indictade by the referent of the tagged sumti.  See also: lifri, ri'i
** Keywords: Experiencing.

!! Examples of ''se ri'i'' Usage

''mi gleki plipe se ri'i la'e di'u''
I jumped for joy when that happened.

!! Proposed Definition of ''ra'i''

;__ra'i__ (BAI):  From source.  Tags a sumti as fitting the 1st place of krasi.  Augments the bridi in which it occurs, adding an extra, un-numbered place with the meaning of the 1st place of krasi and then fills it with the tagged sumti.  In other words, the tagged sumti indicates that the event described by the bridi is from the source or origin or starting point indicated by the referent of the tagged sumti.  See also: krasi, se ra'i
** Keywords: From source.

!! Examples of ''ra'i'' Usage

''mi ciska lo lisri ra'i lo nu mi pensi lo ranmi''
I write a story, based on my thinking about myths.

!! Proposed Definition of ''se ra'i''

;__se ra'i__ (BAI*):  As an origin of.  Tags a sumti as fitting the 2nd place of krasi.  Augments the bridi in which it occurs, adding an extra, un-numbered place with the meaning of the 2nd place of krasi and then fills it with the tagged sumti.  In other words, the tagged sumti indicates that the event described by the bridi is associated with an origin or starting point of the referent of the tagged sumti.  See also: krasi, ra'i
** Keywords: Origin of.

!! Examples of ''se ra'i'' Usage

''mi vitke la torontos be se ra'i la .maik.maiyrs.''
I visit Toronto, which Mike Myers is from.

!! Proposed Definition of ''ka'a''

;__ka'a__ (BAI):  Gone to by.  Tags a sumti as fitting the 1st place of klama.  Augments the bridi in which it occurs, adding an extra, un-numbered place with the meaning of the 1st place of klama and then fills it with the tagged sumti.  In other words, the tagged sumti indicates that the event described by the bridi is associated with the going of the referent of the tagged sumti.  See also: klama, se ka'a, te ka'a, ve ka'a, xe ka'a.
** Keywords: Gone to by.

!! Examples of ''ka'a'' Usage

''mi vitke lo dinju be ka'a le jibri jatna be mi''
I visit the building which my boss went to.

!! Proposed Definition of ''se ka'a''

;__se ka'a__ (BAI*):  With destination. Tags a sumti as fitting the 2nd place of klama.  Augments the bridi in which it occurs, adding an extra, un-numbered place with the meaning of the 2nd place of klama and then fills it with the tagged sumti.  In other words, the tagged sumti indicates that the event described by the bridi is associated with a destination of going indicated by the referent of the tagged sumti.  See also: klama, ka'a, te ka'a, ve ka'a, xe ka'a.
** Keywords: With destination.

!! Examples of ''se ka'a'' Usage

''mi cadzu se ka'a le zarci''
I walk to the store.

!! Proposed Definition of ''te ka'a''

;__te ka'a__ (BAI*):  With origin.  Tags a sumti as fitting the 3rd place of klama.  Augments the bridi in which it occurs, adding an extra, un-numbered place with the meaning of the 3rd place of klama and then fills it with the tagged sumti.  In other words, the tagged sumti indicates that the event described by the bridi is associated with an origin of going indicated by the referent of the tagged sumti.  See also: klama, ka'a, se ka'a, ve ka'a, xe ka'a.
** Keywords: With origin.

!! Examples of ''te ka'a'' Usage

''mi cadzu te ka'a le zarci''
I walk from the store.

!! Proposed Definition of ''ve ka'a''

;__ve ka'a__ (BAI*):  Via route.  Tags a sumti as fitting the 4th place of klama.  Augments the bridi in which it occurs, adding an extra, un-numbered place with the meaning of the 4th place of klama and then fills it with the tagged sumti.  In other words, the tagged sumti indicates that the event described by the bridi is associated with a route of going indicated by the referent of the tagged sumti.  See also: klama, ka'a, se ka'a, te ka'a, xe ka'a.
** Keywords: Via route.

!! Examples of ''ve ka'a'' Usage

''mi cadzu ve ka'a le re moi dargu''
I walk via second street.

!! Proposed Definition of ''xe ka'a''

;__xe ka'a__ (BAI*):  By transportation mode.  Tags a sumti as fitting the 5th place of klama.  Augments the bridi in which it occurs, adding an extra, un-numbered place with the meaning of the 5th place of klama and then fills it with the tagged sumti.  In other words, the tagged sumti indicates that the event described by the bridi is associated with a transportation mode or method indicated by the referent of the tagged sumti.  See also: klama, ka'a, se ka'a, te ka'a, ve ka'a.
** Keywords: By transportation mode.

!! Examples of ''xe ka'a'' Usage

''mi vitke la .kalifornias. xe ka'a lo trene''
I visit California by train.

